  "subtitle": "",
  "subtitle_en": "",
  "lead": "一顆平常看不見的星，亮了幾天。山上的每個人，都替它取了一個名字。",
  "lead_en": "A star no one could usually see shone for a few days. Everyone on the hill gave it a name.",
  "statement_title": "",
  "statement": "一顆平常看不見的星，亮了幾天。山上的每個人，都替它取了一個名字。\n\n鎮上要她交出一個。\n她交出了一整面牆。",
  "statement_en": "A star no one could usually see shone for a few days. Everyone on the hill gave it a name.\n\nThe town asked her for one.\nShe gave them a whole wall.",
  "afterword": "鎮上要她交出一個。\n她交出了一整面牆。",
  "afterword_en": "The town asked her for one.\nShe gave them a whole wall.",
  "series_statement": "《神話未完成》\n史旺姬走進流傳至今的神話，留下它最核心的問題，讓它面對今天的生活。神話一直被講述、被使用，所以還沒有完成。",
  "series_statement_en": "Myths in the Making\nSwanky Ji steps into myths that are still being told, keeps the question at their heart, and lets it meet the life we live now. A myth that is still told and still used is not yet finished.",
